# Implementation Checklist v1 (PoC Single-Player, Static Web)

## Scope and hard constraints
- [ ] Runtime is 100% browser, deploy only on GitHub Pages (no backend).
- [ ] Experience is strictly single-player local (no network sync, no multiplayer hooks).
- [ ] Public APIs only, no API keys.
- [ ] Local persistence in IndexedDB (Cache Storage optional).
- [ ] World stream must scale by tiles and be camera-anchor driven.
- [ ] Road layout fidelity to OSM is top priority (1:1 in plan view).

## Global architecture goals
- [ ] Implement layered pipeline: `Data -> Topology -> Mesh Build -> Render -> Stream`.
- [ ] Keep modules isolated by responsibility to avoid cross-layer coupling.
- [ ] Add schema/versioning strategy for cached payloads.
- [ ] Add deterministic seed strategy per tile for decoration stability.
- [ ] Add performance budget per tile (build time, triangles, memory).

